1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,880
Who was the thief?
谁是小偷？

2
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,330
Who was the thief?
谁是小偷？

3
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:20,060
People are not so honest as they once were.
人们不再像以前那样诚实了。

4
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:27,720
The temptation to steal is greater than ever before especially in large shops.
偷窃的诱惑力比以往任何时候都大，尤其是在大商店里。

5
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:36,560
A detective recently watched a well-dressed woman who always went into a large store on Monday mornings.
最近一名侦探监视了一个穿着讲究的女人，她总是在星期一上午进一家大商场。

6
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:39,270
One Monday,
有一个星期一，

7
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:44,270
there were fewer people in the shop than usual when the woman came in,
当这个女人走进商场时，里面的人比往常少，

8
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:48,660
so it was easier for the detective to watch her.
所以侦探更容易监视她。

9
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:53,900
The woman first bought a few small articles.
女人先买了几样小东西。

10
00:00:54,750 --> 00:01:01,170
After a little time, she chose one of the most expensive dresses in the shop
过了一会儿，她挑了店里最贵的一件连衣裙

11
00:01:01,190 --> 00:01:07,330
and handed it to an assistant who wrapped it up for her as quickly as possible.
把它递给售货员，售货员以最快的速度为她包好。

12
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:14,690
Then the woman simply took the parcel and walked out of the shop without paying.
然后女人拿上包裹，没付钱就走出了商场。

13
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,090
When she was arrested,
当她被捕时，

14
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:23,310
the detective found out that the shop assistant was her daughter.
侦探发现那个售货员是她的女儿。

15
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:29,220
The girl 'gave' her mother a free dress once a week!
这个姑娘每周“送”给母亲一件免费的连衣裙！
